msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset all plugin data? This will:\n"
"\n"
"• Disable the built-in language system\n"
"• Remove all configured languages\n"
"• Reset the onboarding/welcome screen\n"
"• Clear dependency status cache\n"
"\n"
"Your API key, translated pages, and other settings will be preserved.\n"
"\n"
"Continue?"
